{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.poster.avif?t=1764693095\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.webm?t=1764693095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/extras/8562018398caf37db31aaadbffb0e31c.mp4?t=1764693095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cobalt System is a first-person shooter game that allows you to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of ancient Mars. Playing as a guardian of an abandoned temple complex, fight your way through many obstacles and enemies of different types in order to obtain a lost relic that can change the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore levels and find secret locations as well as various ancient artifacts that will give more understanding about the Martian civilization, which is on the verge of collapse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3200030?t=1764693095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3200030?t=1764693095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/b66756fc703dfb469abf68ddb52855f15f7ea869/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764693095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200030/b66756fc703dfb469abf68ddb52855f15f7ea869/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764693095","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"b